    {
      "title": "Kimberly Guilfoyle steps down as US ambassador to Greece after alleged misconduct",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/13/kimberly-guilfoyle-ambassador-greece-step-down",
      "description": "<p>White House asked Guilfoyle, who is alleged to have sought a bill payment from a Trump donor, to resign from post</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/oct/13/donald-trump-ilhan-omar-katie-zacharia-alaska-midterms-latest-news-updates\">US politics live – latest updates</a></p></li></ul><p>Kimberly Guilfoyle is stepping down as US ambassador to Greece after weeks of reports that she sought payment from a Trump donor in exchange for access to administration officials.</p><p>The decision, announced by the White House on Tuesday morning, ends the diplomatic career of one of Donald Trump’s longest-standing political allies. It came after the US president and Marco Rubio, the secretary of state, were <a href=\"https://apnews.com/article/trump-rubio-guilfoyle-364465fc46b023cacf2b70c94cc76ae2\">reported </a>to have grown furious over the allegations.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/13/kimberly-guilfoyle-ambassador-greece-step-down\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-13T18:16:17"
    },
    {
      "title": "Kimberly Guilfoyle denies allegations of misconduct as she resigns as US ambassador to Greece – live",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/oct/13/donald-trump-ilhan-omar-katie-zacharia-alaska-midterms-latest-news-updates",
      "description": "<p>Guilfoyle has been under immense scrutiny after the Wall Street Journal reported on a series of questionable acts prior to securing her role in Athens</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/news/2026/feb/17/sign-up-for-the-breaking-news-us-email-to-get-newsletter-alerts-direct-to-your-inbox?utm_medium=ACQUISITIONS_STANDFIRST&amp;utm_campaign=BN22326&amp;utm_content=signup&amp;utm_term=standfirst&amp;utm_source=GUARDIAN_WEB\">Sign up for the US Breaking News email</a></p></li></ul><p>Ahead of her White House podium debut, <strong>Katie Zacharia</strong> reportedly monitored Donald Trump’s public schedule every day, and monitored his Truth Social, and made sure she was on-air when she assumed he might be watching, <a href=\"https://www.politico.com/playbook\">according to Politico</a>, citing a person familiar with the matter.</p><p>That source noted that and a number of high-profile conservative anchors – including from Fox News, Newsmax and OANN – also backed Zacharia for press secretary. <strong>She is now set to the sixth person to hold the role throughout both of Trump’s terms in office.</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/oct/13/donald-trump-ilhan-omar-katie-zacharia-alaska-midterms-latest-news-updates\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-13T18:16:08"
    },
